            'official_visa_name' => 'Iran Family (Marital) Visa and Relatives Visa (via Consulate General of Iran, Mumbai / Hyderabad)',
            'visa_subclass_code' => null,
            'intro_html' => '<p>Iran\'s Ministry of Foreign Affairs (mfa.ir) publishes two genuinely distinct consular visas relevant to family travel from India, confirmed on the Mumbai and Hyderabad consulate pages: a Family (Marital) Visa specifically for the foreign spouse (and children) of an Iranian citizen whose marriage is registered in Iran, and a separate Relatives Visa for visiting Iran-based relatives more broadly, which requires a grant notice obtained in Iran before the consulate will process the application. Iran\'s political and security situation is a separate matter from these formal visa rules and is not addressed here.</p>',
