            'application_method' => 'Baseline entry via the official e-Visa portal (evisa.iq); Kurdistan Region spousal residency: foreign spouse outside Iraq must first obtain a pre-entry visa, then apply in-country for the residency card; federal Iraq dependent route (for a foreign worker\'s spouse) reportedly requires an authenticated marriage certificate, per an unofficial source',
            'interview_required' => 'Not independently confirmed',
