            'indian_applicant_html' => '<h4 style=\'margin:0 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Who Applies</h4><p>Each dependant applies individually via the LIS online portal (rp.lis.gov.lr), though the application is reportedly linked to the principal sponsor\'s existing Residence Permit or work permit.</p><h4 style=\'margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Documents You Will Likely Need</h4><ul><li>Valid Indian passport</li><li>Marriage certificate (spouse) or birth certificate (minor dependant)</li><li>Evidence of lawful entry into Liberia</li><li>Health/medical documentation, per secondary sources</li></ul><h4 style=\'margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>What Your Sponsor Will Need</h4><p>Their own valid work permit or Residence Permit, and the ability to add you as a dependant on their LIS portal application.</p><p>Given the thin official detail available, we recommend confirming current requirements directly on rp.lis.gov.lr or with our consultants before applying.</p>',
