            'application_centre' => 'Notification of family reunification filed in Moldova by the sponsor with GIM/BMA; the Type D long-stay visa itself is lodged at the Moldovan Embassy/Consulate serving India (or via evisa.gov.md for the short-stay Type C route, where eligible).',
