            'indian_applicant_html' => '<h4 style=\'margin:0 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Sponsor Requirements (Kept Separate From Yours)</h4><ul><li>Valid Namibian work, study, or permanent-residence permit</li><li>Namibian immigration generally expects the sponsor to show the marriage is genuine</li></ul><h4 style=\'margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Your Documents as the Applicant</h4><ul><li>Marriage certificate (legal marriage is mandatory — unmarried/life partnerships are not recognised)</li><li>Birth certificate and proof of adoption, if applicable, for a dependent child under 21</li></ul><h4 style=\'margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Before You Travel</h4><p>Separately confirm whether your Indian passport currently requires a Namibian entry visa/eVisa, given the unresolved conflict on this point.</p><p>Our consultants can help confirm current MHAISS requirements and clarify the entry-visa position for your passport before you apply.</p>',
