            'indian_applicant_html' => '<h4 style=\'margin:0 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Evidence Gap</h4><p>No confirmed, India-specific family-visa checklist for Nicaragua was found in this research pass.</p><h4 style=\'margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Likely Documents (Not Confirmed)</h4><ul><li>Proof of relationship to the Nicaraguan citizen/resident (marriage/birth certificate)</li><li>Entry visa, if your nationality is placed in a consular (\'Category C\') list requiring prior immigration authorisation</li></ul><h4 style=\'margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Recommended Next Step</h4><p>Given the conflicting baseline entry-visa information and the near-total absence of confirmed family-residence procedure details, we strongly recommend contacting the Nicaraguan Consulate serving India, or DGME directly, before making any travel or application plans.</p><p>Our consultants can help you frame that direct enquiry.</p>',
