            'eligibility_html' => '<h4 style=\'margin:0 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Family Reunification (Residence Route)</h4><p>Allows a foreign national to obtain residency to join close relatives — spouses, parents, or children — who already hold Paraguayan citizenship or permanent residence. Dependants are generally described as immediate family: spouses and minor children, with proof of the legal relationship required.</p><h4 style=\'margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:16px;\'>Short Family-Visit (Tourist) Route</h4><p>Per the Paraguayan Embassy’s own 2025/2026 documents, requires an invitation letter sent to both the Ministry of Foreign Affairs in Asunción and the embassy in New Delhi, with the inviting individual’s notarised Paraguayan ID copy, plus proof of economic solvency (a personal bank statement covering the last 3 months) and a legalised or apostilled criminal record certificate.</p><p>No distinct unmarried-partner category was identified for either route in search results — do not assume one exists without direct confirmation from Migraciones or the embassy.</p>',
